{"id":"offensichtlich","lemma":"offensichtlich","pos":"adj","rank":813,"glosses":["obvious","evident, apparent"],"ipa":"/ˈʔɔfənzɪçtlɪç/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5d/De-offensichtlich.ogg/De-offensichtlich.ogg.mp3","forms":{"comparative":"offensichtlicher","superlative":"am offensichtlichsten"},"examples":[{"text":"Offensichtlich lügt jemand.","en":"Someone is obviously telling a lie.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/564324","words":[null,{"g":"to tell a lie","l":"lügen"},{"g":"someone, somebody"}]},{"text":"Das war ziemlich offensichtlich.","en":"It was pretty obvious.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756641","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"pretty"},null]},{"text":"Es war sehr offensichtlich.","en":"It was very obvious.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Du brauchst offensichtlich Hilfe.","en":"Obviously, you need help.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"the act of helping"}]},{"text":"Ihr braucht offensichtlich Hilfe.","en":"Obviously, you need help.","words":[{"g":"you (pl.) / her"},{"g":"to need","l":"brauchen"},null,{"g":"the act of helping"}]}]}